<title>USA: Black &amp; Decker Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Black &amp; Decker Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>TOWSON, Md. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Call Q4 mean estimate was $0.91 per share.</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.94		    $1.26</p>
<p> Net			 90,600		  120,000</p>
<p> Sales		  1,454,800		1,440,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  96,500		   95,400</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.38		    $2.37</p>
<p> Net			229,600		  224,000</p>
<p> Sales		  4,914,400		4,766,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  96,300		   94,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
